<title>USA: Bristol Technology board oks buyback.</title>
<headline>Bristol Technology board oks buyback.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bristol Technology Systems Inc said its board has authorized the company, over a 20-month period, to repurchase its common stock from time to time and in such amounts as are believed by management to be in the best interests of the company and its shareholders.</p>
<p>In this regard, shares of the company's common stock may be purchased by or for the company, when market prices present an attractive opportunity considered by management to be a good investment of corporate funds.</p>
</text>
